    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing tho—sometimes it's hard to tell if a fever is just from the surgery stress or if something deeper is actually going on inside. what are the specific red flags for a systemic infection that might not be obvious right away?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
